            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.15.25+ROM.15.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bar. 15.25-26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nono, khuloondekhana ne chirupia chikhoyeele khurusibwa khuyeeta babaandu ba Wele mu Buyuda. Khukhwola mukhole nisio naboolela chikanisa mu Kalatia khukhola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli khu ndaalo eyo Mwami buli sia mulala khwinywe khukhwola are alubeka chirupia, khuloondekhana nende nisio anyoolile mu muruungo, mala muchibiikhe nio mukhenaana khubuusia chirupia ne nichile tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne nichile, khaelesie babaandu nibo muroboore chibarwa che khubamanyisia mala mbarume bayile siianwa sienywe Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kaaba bali buli bulayi ese khucha, aba khache nabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lirekekha lia Paulo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
