                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Chikanisa mu sibala sia Esia chimurumira enywe kimileembe kiabwe, Akwila ne Pirisila ne kanisa eyakaanananga munju yabwe bamukhesiisie kimileembe kimikali mu Mwami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
